      {
        "section_anchor": {
          "header_text": "The ontology: how everything connects",
          "_metadata": {
            "uid": "csa0bc73181cf6ca46"
          },
          "section_id": "the-ontology-how-everything-connects"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": {
          "text_content": {
            "type": "doc",
            "attrs": {},
            "uid": "70125c401ca1494aaf47f54f952c1a4d",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "uid": "b218c84df59f459dbc9f1fab5ca8d51e",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "An ontology is a model of relationships. Not what data means, but how things relate to each other."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "p",
                "uid": "da14070cf0674d728717c012c39fa0c3",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Night Market isn't just a row in a table. It's connected to a studio contract, a production budget, subscribers, viewing events, release windows, and the broader content slate. That web of connections is an ontology:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "p",
                "uid": "ce3f6514d1b34532810fc2365a39f942",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "For example:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "ul",
                "uid": "943ac16a772d461097cf12d9c8f545e2",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "li",
                    "uid": "5918f25b679641b5abb53e36c0a9d5c7",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "p",
                        "uid": "9b875ef509e34c4db6e44193a419c944",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "Show"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "li",
                    "uid": "eb988648727d4b8cac9ffc3efab33cfa",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "p",
                        "uid": "e590207731c94951ae595ca6dc2bcad8",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "...has Episodes"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "li",
                    "uid": "dc8a0ed37e124734a78d2d30a621af9a",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "p",
                        "uid": "5d62db350e8b415585cddcfb574ae9f3",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "...that have Viewership Events"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "li",
                    "uid": "4925f133dbfd4012aa81fc922aa35d19",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "p",
                        "uid": "8538fa6ec0664e1caefd72abc4cddc7e",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "...that have Subscribers (with a Retention Status)"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "p",
                "uid": "6a1f0b72c2534caba9c824b6c1ecdbf1",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Without an ontology, AI may discover (or invent) relationships, but it has no governed model of how your business is organized. With one, it can navigate your data the way your best analyst does."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "_version": 1
          },
          "_metadata": {
            "uid": "cs50d9721deb7f1d77"
          }
        }
      },
      {
