      {
        "section_anchor": {
          "header_text": "The knowledge graph: the blueprint, populated",
          "_metadata": {
            "uid": "cs87bdd7d604c74a72"
          },
          "section_id": "the-knowledge-graph-the-blueprint-populated"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": {
          "text_content": {
            "type": "doc",
            "attrs": {},
            "uid": "e0ba48dc1bbe421dbac400e862102909",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "uid": "55f82a3c5b3e4792a7255fd90124ac7b",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "An ontology is a blueprint. A knowledge graph is that blueprint filled with real, connected data. So, for Night Market:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "p",
                "uid": "d32da70da367476f8eaa708294e427d5",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Night Market (Show #S-2291)",
                    "bold": true
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "ul",
                "uid": "164959f582634318a788ff0b0b3b8612",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "li",
                    "uid": "b7aba33825dc4b69a1f75363cacabaf3",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "p",
                        "uid": "120bc9fa3f58400eaf6849e7d9cc90fe",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "The Node: Thriller, Released March 2026, 8 Episodes, 4.2/5 rating, 2 Emmy nominations."
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "li",
                    "uid": "9dd42cb4fde64d5fb43a6a0954b09011",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "p",
                        "uid": "2a7a82df813b40e69f70964eb39ee8b1",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "Connected Viewership: 2.4M views, 87% completion rate."
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "li",
                    "uid": "904007d402e24b50a7a0d50137ef679e",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "p",
                        "uid": "1c13e2265a6143d6a57dc2f606c00c52",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "Connected Financials: $4M production cost, 12K new subscribers acquired."
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "li",
                    "uid": "ef706a829e4e40ac8fcb00991e4cfd3f",
                    "attrs": {},
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "p",
                        "uid": "ee7d4033f15f4b1a9c98f912983b784c",
                        "attrs": {},
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "Contextual Note: Highest-performing debut in the drama category since 2023"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "p",
                "uid": "d5ae6cd2e4ec429dae034d8aa048e963",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Three components make it work: entities (the specific nodes: the show, each episode, each subscriber event), connections (which show drove which subscriber acquisitions, which production budget maps to which slate window), and details (the completion rate, the cost, the rating)."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "_version": 1
          },
          "_metadata": {
            "uid": "cs789ee76f10a71f73"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "text": {
